 permit needed to distribute audiovisual content"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Servers placed in China must be registered; ISPs must hold a value-added telecom license"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Requiring sellers to join the platform means the platform must verify identities, register data, report information, and retain records for three years"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"You must regulate user-generated content: moderation mechanisms, reporting portals, and immediate takedown plus reporting of illegal material"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Providing information publishing and instant messaging services requires users to provide authentic identity information"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"No live streaming accounts may be created for anyone under 16; tipping limits are set by age group"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Respond promptly to infringement notices; restore content after 15 days if no response"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Personal information must not be casually transferred overseas; legal conditions and thresholds apply"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"When picking a server, first consider how much downtime you can tolerate, then check whether there’s any support available, and only then compare prices"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/26"},"children":["Chapter 26"," ·"," ","Building a website or platform: licensing, registration, and servers"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"26-02"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["02"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Most paid websites need a license; self-operated sales without outside sellers do not; transaction platforms need a different permit; free sites only need filing"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Most websites that charge users need a Value-Added Telecommunications Business License, which individuals cannot obtain. A company selling goods or services on its own site or app without admitting other sellers does not need this license. Businesses operating only through WeChat or Alipay mini-programs, official accounts, or online stores are also exempt. If a required license is missing, revenue can be confiscated, fines imposed, and serious cases can lead to closure."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Registration is free of charge. Obtaining a Value-Added Te…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The regulations state: “The state implements a licensing system for commercial Internet information services a…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Most paid websites need a license; self-operated sales without outside sellers do not; transaction platforms need a different permit; free sites only need filing"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Registration is free of charge. Obtaining a Value-Added Telecommunications Business License, however, involves costs; this license governs whether websites that charge users can legally operate. To apply for this license, you must first establish a company. For operations limited to one province, the registered capital must be at least 1 million RMB; for nationwide operations, it must be at least 10 million RMB. The review period lasts 60 days, and the license remains valid for 5 years."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The regulations state: “The state implements a licensing system for commercial Internet information services and a registration system for non-commercial ones. No entity may provide Internet information services without obtaining a license or completing registration.” In other words, paid services must first secure a license, while free ones must register; operating without either is prohibited. “Commercial services” are defined as activities involving paid provision of information or webpage creation to users. Platforms that facilitate transactions are classified under Online Data Processing and Transaction Processing Services, commonly abbreviated as EDI. These services involve using data and transaction platforms linked to public communication networks to handle data processing and transactions on behalf of users. Such activities include transaction processing, electronic data exchange, and data handling via network devices. Operating without a license or exceeding its scope of permission results in confiscation of all illegal revenues and fines ranging from 3 to 5 times that amount. If no illegal revenues exist or they are under 50,000 RMB, fines between 100,000 and 1,000,000 RMB apply; severe violations may lead to website closure nationwide. Charging users does not always mean a license is required. An October 2025 FAQ from the Guangdong Communications Administration says that, under MIIT requirements, three situations do not require this license: a company sells its own or other companies’ goods or services directly on its own website or app, without allowing outside sellers to open shops; a company publishes only its own information on its site or app, without providing a publishing platform for others; or a company operates only through third-party WeChat or Alipay mini-programs, official accounts, video accounts, or online stores, with no independently operated platform. Allowing others to open shops or post information falls outside these exceptions."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["广东省通信管理局 (2025). 关于办理增值电信业务经营许可证的常见问题解答（2025 年 10 月 17 日，第一项）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://gdca.miit.gov.cn/bsfw/bszn/jyxk/tzgg/art/2025/art_6bcbfa4f041247868c0de08e765b33e9.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://gdca.miit.gov.cn/bsfw/bszn/jyxk/tzgg/art/2025/art_6bcbfa4f041247868c0de08e765b33e9.html"]}," ; 国务院 (2000). 互联网信息服务管理办法（国务院令第 292 号，2024 年 12 月 6 日第二次修订，第三、四、七、十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1860864.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1860864.htm"]}," ; 国务院 (2024). 关于修改和废止部分行政法规的决定（国务院令第 797 号，第十八项）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2025/issue_11786/202501/content_6997034.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2025/issue_11786/202501/content_6997034.html"]}," ; 国务院 (2000). 电信条例（2016 年第二次修订，第七、九、十三、六十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2016/content_5139478.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2016/content_5139478.htm"]}," ; 工业和信息化部 (2017). 电信业务经营许可管理办法（工信部令第 42 号，第六、九、十一、十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2017/content_5240090.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2017/content_5240090.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://gdca.miit.gov.cn/bsfw/bszn/jyxk/tzgg/art/2025/art_6bcbfa4f041247868c0de08e765b33e9.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["To determine whether your platform qualifies as an EDI service, compare its activities to the definitions listed in the Telecommunications Business Classification Catalogue. No official regulation explicitly states that e-commerce platforms handling transactions and payments must obtain an EDI license. The Ministry of Industry and Information Technology’s guidelines merely advise applying for the appropriate license based on actual business activities. Therefore, this section merely outlines definitions without making any definitive conclusions. Additionally, only legally incorporated companies may apply for this license; individuals are ineligible. These three exemptions come from a Guangdong Communications Administration FAQ that says it follows MIIT requirements; we have not found equally explicit public wording from other provinces. If your case is uncertain, call your local communications administration. The same FAQ says official applications are free and should be f